---
// Site footer with navigation, legal links, and contact info
---
<footer class="mt-auto border-t" style="border-color: var(--color-g-hairline); background-color: var(--color-g-canvas);">
  <div class="section-container py-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 pb-8" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
      <!-- Brand & Summary -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-base" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 488 488" fill="none" class="shrink-0 rounded-[5px]" aria-label="Logo Calculadora de Horas Extras Online">
            <rect width="488" height="488" rx="122" fill="#1C1C1C"/>
            <circle cx="244" cy="244" r="166.67" stroke="#3C9EFF" stroke-width="32.17" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <polyline points="244 144 244 244 310.67 277.33" stroke="#3C9EFF" stroke-width="32.17" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Calculadora<span style="color: var(--color-g-link);">HE</span>Online</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
          Calculadora de horas extras online rápida e precisa, baseada na legislação trabalhista brasileira (CLT). Grátis, privada e atualizada para 2026.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="mono-eyebrow mb-3">EXPLORAR</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:underline transition-colors" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
              Calculadora de Horas Extras
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sobre-nos/" class="hover:underline transition-colors" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
              Sobre Nós
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/fale-conosco/" class="hover:underline transition-colors" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
              Fale Conosco
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal & Contact -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="mono-eyebrow mb-3">LEGAL E SUPORTE</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/politica-de-privacidade/" class="hover:underline transition-colors" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
              Política de Privacidade
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/termos-e-condicoes/" class="hover:underline transition-colors" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
              Termos e Condições
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="pt-2">
            <span class="text-[11px] block mono-eyebrow mb-1">Contato Direto</span>
            <a href="mailto:contato@calculadoradehorasextrasonline.com" class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm hover:underline font-medium" style="color: var(--color-g-link);">
              contato@calculadoradehorasextrasonline.com
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-3">
      <p class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--color-g-mute);">
        © 2026 CalculadoraDeHorasExtrasOnline.com • Todos os direitos reservados.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] italic" style="color: var(--color-g-faint);">
        Apenas estimativas. Não substitui assessoria jurídica, fiscal ou de folha de pagamento.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
